#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get started with the Sampler backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-"
"sampler-backend-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Pierwsze kroki z prymitywem backendu Sampler {#get-started-with-the-sampler-"
"backend-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Sampler primitive can be run with any provider by using "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2)."
" However, it requires a backend that supports the `memory` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"Prymityw Sampler można uruchamiać z dowolnym dostawcą przy użyciu "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2)."
" Wymaga on jednak backendu obsługującego opcję `memory`.\n"

